# EtPreviewContainer Component - Agent Guide

## Overview

`EtPreviewContainer` is a dumb, reusable floating glass preview card. It owns the Liquid Glass / blur shell, optional grab handle, press + haptics, optional absolute placement above the tab bar, and optional hide-with-tab-bar animation. Domain content (labels, values, charts) is composed by the consumer.

**Location:** `/libs/etoro-ui/src/components/preview-container/`

## Key Features

- **Compound Component Pattern**: `Content` (left text stack) and `Trailing` (right visual)
- **Liquid Glass**: Native iOS 26+ glass via `EtGlassView`; frosted blur fallback elsewhere
- **Floating mode**: Pins above the bottom tab bar + safe-area inset
- **Tab-bar sync**: Slides/fades with `useTabBarVisibility` when `syncWithTabBar`
- **Grab handle**: Centred pill at the top (toggle with `showHandle`)

## Usage

```tsx
import { EtPreviewContainer, EtText, EtSparkChart } from 'etoro-ui';

<EtPreviewContainer
  floating
  syncWithTabBar
  onPress={handleOpen}
  accessibilityLabel="My portfolio value"
  testID="portfolio-peek-card"
>
  <EtPreviewContainer.Content>
    <EtText variant="label-tertiary-regular">My portfolio value</EtText>
    {/* live value leaf */}
  </EtPreviewContainer.Content>
  <EtPreviewContainer.Trailing>
    <EtSparkChart data={sparkData} balance="positive" width={100} height={26} />
  </EtPreviewContainer.Trailing>
</EtPreviewContainer>
```

Without `floating`, the consumer owns positioning (same as `EtGlassFab`).

## Subcomponents

| Component | Description |
| --------- | ----------- |
| `EtPreviewContainer.Content` | Left flex-shrink text stack (label + value) |
| `EtPreviewContainer.Trailing` | Right trailing visual (sparkline, icon, etc.) |

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| ---- | ---- | ------- | ----------- |
| `children` | `ReactNode` | required | Compound Content / Trailing |
| `onPress` | `() => void` | - | Press handler (after haptic) |
| `accessibilityLabel` | `string` | - | A11y label |
| `floating` | `boolean` | `false` | Absolute above tab bar |
| `syncWithTabBar` | `boolean` | `false` | Hide with tab bar (needs `floating`) |
| `showHandle` | `boolean` | `true` | Grab handle |
| `haptics` | `boolean` | `true` | Light impact on press |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` | Disable press |
| `style` | `StyleProp<ViewStyle>` | - | Outer style |
| `testID` | `string` | - | Test ID on pressable |

## Exported constants

- `PREVIEW_HEIGHT` (96) — approx height for off-screen hide / list bottom padding
- `PREVIEW_CONTAINER_BOTTOM_OFFSET` — `TAB_BAR_HEIGHT + 12` gap above the nav bar

## Do / Don't

- **DO** keep domain data (facades, currency, privacy mask, sheet bodies) in the feature
- **DO** compose label/value/chart as children
- **DON'T** put business logic or API calls inside this component
- **DON'T** set `opacity < 1` on the glass surface itself (breaks liquid glass)

